# bpmninja
===
 Lean BPMN 2.0 workflow engine in Rust — token-based execution, NATS JetStream persistence, Axum REST API, Rhai scripting and a Tauri desktop UI with bpmn-js. Camunda-compatible external tasks, ISO 8601 timers, incident management.
